{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/4fe1cacc87c464472de6a49676c92e3f.poster.avif?t=1763546683\" width=592 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/4fe1cacc87c464472de6a49676c92e3f.webm?t=1763546683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/4fe1cacc87c464472de6a49676c92e3f.mp4?t=1763546683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screaming head is a <strong>DIFFICULT</strong> 2d platformer. You WILL rage, you WILL suffer and you WILL bite your gamepad as you traverse across 6 different zones as a polyamorous head that pushes his enemies away by <strong>SCREAMING AT THEM!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/551a197dde33edb0a229b1927fe2afae.avif?t=1763546683\" width=569 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wives have been kidnapped, your garden has been stomped, your face has been spat at and your life has been destroyed by <strong>your own body</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have to lock in and <strong>prove once and for all that mind rules over matter and not the other way around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/59332abab84186160be75d1ef3be5174.avif?t=1763546683\" width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This colorful gem of a gaming experience with unbelievably punchy soundtrack and infuriatingly pushy enemies is everything you need! <i>(if everything you need is a game about a head that is screaming)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/793c588e3711d57e5ddb656d9c9fe7b3.apng?t=1763546683\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/793c588e3711d57e5ddb656d9c9fe7b3.poster.avif?t=1763546683\" class=\"bb_img\" width=84 height=84 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/3bda4bef4518b987fd02ca49462b487f.apng?t=1763546683\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/3bda4bef4518b987fd02ca49462b487f.poster.avif?t=1763546683\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We've got:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 warp zones to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 levels to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eclectic soundtrack with licensed songs from Girls Rituals, 8485, Ushko, Jymenik and Axti-Xti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/0de198eefcf4482a6a9c4b11a52c0016.apng?t=1763546683\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/0de198eefcf4482a6a9c4b11a52c0016.poster.avif?t=1763546683\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=130 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies</p><p class